---
import DocsLayout from "@layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
    title="Installation"
    description="Install Axon Editor on macOS, Windows, or Linux"
>
    <h1>Installation</h1>

    <p>
        Axon provides native builds for all major platforms. Download the latest
        release from the <a href="/download">download page</a> or build from source.
    </p>

    <h2>macOS</h2>

    <h3>Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4)</h3>
    <pre><code>Download Axon-{">version"}-arm64.dmg
Open the DMG and drag Axon to Applications</code></pre>

    <h3>Intel</h3>
    <pre><code>Download Axon-{">version"}.dmg
Open the DMG and drag Axon to Applications</code></pre>

    <div class="rounded-md border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/5 p-4 my-6">
        <p class="text-sm">
            Current macOS builds are unsigned personal builds. You may need to
            right-click and select "Open" to bypass Gatekeeper.
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Windows</h2>
    <pre><code>Download Axon.Setup.{">version"}.exe
Run the installer and follow the prompts</code></pre>

    <h2>Linux</h2>

    <h3>AppImage</h3>
    <pre><code>Download Axon-{">version"}.AppImage
chmod +x Axon-*.AppImage
./Axon-*.AppImage</code></pre>

    <h3>Debian/Ubuntu</h3>
    <pre><code>Download axon_{">version"}_amd64.deb
sudo dpkg -i axon_*.deb</code></pre>

    <h2>Building from Source</h2>
    <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/GordenArcher/axon
cd axon

# Terminal 1: Start Go backend
cd core
go run cmd/axon/main.go

# Terminal 2: Start Electron app
cd editor
npm install
npm run build:main
npm run dev</code></pre>

    <h2>System Requirements</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>macOS</strong>: 10.15 or later</li>
        <li><strong>Windows</strong>: Windows 10 or later</li>
        <li><strong>Linux</strong>: glibc 2.28 or later</li>
        <li><strong>RAM</strong>: 512MB minimum, 2GB recommended</li>
        <li>
            <strong>Storage</strong>: 200MB for editor, additional for language
            servers
        </li>
    </ul>
</DocsLayout>
